::.body_md:
Assignment operator.


`::` is the same as `:` (which see) except that `::` evaluates
its left-hand side as well as its right-hand side.


Examples:













```maxima
maxima

(%i1) x : 'foo;
(%o1)                          foo


(%i2) x :: 123;
(%o2)                          123


(%i3) foo;
(%o3)                          123


(%i4) x : '[a, b, c];
(%o4)                       [a, b, c]


(%i5) x :: [11, 22, 33];
(%o5)                     [11, 22, 33]


(%i6) a;
(%o6)                          11


(%i7) b;
(%o7)                          22


(%i8) c;
(%o8)                          33
```

See also: `:`.

